      "cooked": "<p>Against Mad Bomber Blade all looked lost.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Then we noticed that Fixer, if incapacitated, could put Fanatic's Aegis in play from the trash and Bunker, if incapacitated, could put Fanatic's Wrathful Retribution into hand from the trash. SO, we decided to let the Ambitious Racketeer knock those two out.&nbsp;</p><p>Final HP: Fixer, Bunker, Unity - zero; Fanatic - 2</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have never before seen a game where Fanatic got to use Wrathful Retribution THREE times!</p>",
